<title>JAPAN: Kanda Corp  -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanda Corp  -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     9.44		vs	    8.73</p>
<p> Operating	  536 million	 vs	  570 million</p>
<p> Current	    461 million	 vs	  426 million</p>
<p> Net		  231 million	 vs	  239 million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.36 yen	  vs	   27.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kanda Corp is involved in the cargo transport and distribution business.</p>
</text>
